1
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:02,039
All right, one, two, three, go!

2
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,240
Smoke quite a lot, don't you?

3
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:21,759
Old Chen.

4
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,280
You must know

5
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:27,960
why we're here, right?

6
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:42,039
I asked them for compensation.

7
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:45,719
Her family got my daughter-in-law killed,

8
00:02:45,719 --> 00:02:48,360
and the 50,000 bride price was wasted.

9
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:50,719
But her daughter wouldn't admit it.

10
00:02:51,479 --> 00:02:53,639
She said her dad got the death penalty,

11
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:56,360
her mom spent six months in prison,

12
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:59,639
and their hair salon went out of business.

13
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:04,120
She even said I owed them!

14
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,960
You can't do something like this over that!

15
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,319
Don't "you" me!

16
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:12,360
I can't let this go!

17
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:15,599
So I...

18
00:03:19,159 --> 00:03:20,319
I prepared...

19
00:03:22,199 --> 00:03:24,520
six kilograms of sodium cyanide.

20
00:03:26,199 --> 00:03:27,199
Last night,

21
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,400
I took that bag of poison

22
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:33,240
and dumped it all into their well.

23
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:42,719
Do you realize you're committing murder?

24
00:03:45,759 --> 00:03:47,240
He killed my grandson,

25
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,919
so I kill his daughter.

26
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,360
A life for a life.

27
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,560
It's a fair trade.

28
00:03:51,919 --> 00:03:52,719
Grandson?

29
00:03:53,599 --> 00:03:54,919
What grandson?

30
00:03:55,319 --> 00:03:55,879
I...

31
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:58,680
Well...

32
00:03:59,159 --> 00:04:01,240
If my daughter-in-law hadn't died,

33
00:04:01,479 --> 00:04:03,360
she would've given me a grandson!

34
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,520
Are you even human?!

35
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:14,520
I...

36
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:39,839
On my first call out,

37
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:43,000
I ran right into

38
00:04:44,199 --> 00:04:45,480
a double homicide.

39
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:48,920
What a shame.

40
00:04:50,279 --> 00:04:51,439
All that red was blood.

41
00:04:57,319 --> 00:04:59,199
They're just an ignorant bunch.

42
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,040
Wrong.

43
00:05:02,279 --> 00:05:03,240
Not ignorance.

44
00:05:04,639 --> 00:05:06,480
Ignorant of the law. Legally illiterate.

45
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,639
So

46
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,360
what we have to do

47
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:14,720
is use the law as a foundation

48
00:05:15,439 --> 00:05:17,560
to balance all these conflicts.

49
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,120
Balance...

50
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,399
That's an art in itself.

51
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:32,120
Go ahead.

52
00:05:35,759 --> 00:05:36,399
Location.

53
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:39,199
Got it, on my way.

54
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,360
Hurry.

55
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,040
Victim's family?

56
00:06:40,199 --> 00:06:40,959
I'm her husband.

57
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,759
You called it in, right?

58
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:47,199
Tell me.

59
00:06:47,839 --> 00:06:49,240
Tell me how you found

60
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:50,959
the crime scene.

61
00:06:52,879 --> 00:06:54,319
I came home from work today,

62
00:06:54,959 --> 00:06:57,000
and saw a broken key stuck in the lock.

63
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:59,639
So I quickly pulled the key out

64
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,199
and used my own key to open the door.

65
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,360
As soon as the door opened,

66
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,639
I saw my wife lying there,

67
00:07:06,399 --> 00:07:07,279
blood everywhere.

68
00:07:09,199 --> 00:07:09,879
Captain Meng.

69
00:07:11,519 --> 00:07:12,959
This is the victim's phone.

70
00:07:13,279 --> 00:07:14,720
The room hasn't been ransacked.

71
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,160
Understood.

72
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:16,680
Okay.

73
00:07:21,439 --> 00:07:23,560
Did your wife ever tell you

74
00:07:24,959 --> 00:07:26,480
about anyone threatening her,

75
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,680
or maybe

76
00:07:29,439 --> 00:07:30,399
that anything

77
00:07:31,199 --> 00:07:32,199
felt off?

78
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,120
No.

79
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:36,959
She was doing fine lately.

80
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,959
Have the two of you

81
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:42,279
had any conflicts lately?

82
00:07:42,519 --> 00:07:44,000
Like, over something,

83
00:07:45,079 --> 00:07:46,000
did you argue,

84
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,160
or anything like that?

85
00:07:47,519 --> 00:07:48,319
No.

86
00:07:49,879 --> 00:07:51,639
At most, I just talked back once or twice.

87
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:53,600
Over what?

88
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:56,120
Not washing socks, stuff like that.

89
00:08:00,639 --> 00:08:02,759
Is anything missing from the house?

90
00:08:06,439 --> 00:08:08,480
Spread out and check the rest of the room.

91
00:08:08,639 --> 00:08:09,439
Go

92
00:08:10,199 --> 00:08:11,600
check the complex's security footage.

93
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:14,720
See if around the time of the incident,

94
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:17,560
anyone came in or out of here.

95
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:23,319
Captain Meng.

96
00:08:24,319 --> 00:08:25,879
We've finished examining the body.

97
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,319
Good.

98
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,240
Six stab wounds to the back.

99
00:09:11,679 --> 00:09:13,480
And the final slash to the throat

100
00:09:14,919 --> 00:09:15,960
was fatal.

101
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,639
Looks like the killer wasn't after money,

102
00:09:23,799 --> 00:09:25,360
nor was it a Crime of passion.

103
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:29,360
The killer came specifically for her.

104
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:34,039
It's either jealousy or revenge.

105
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,399
The killer followed her inside.

106
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,480
If they followed her,

107
00:09:45,399 --> 00:09:46,799
that means the killer

108
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:48,200
had been stalking her,

109
00:09:50,039 --> 00:09:53,639
or at least studied her daily routine.

110
00:09:55,279 --> 00:09:56,720
Another young life

111
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,240
gone.

112
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:00,919
Captain Meng.

113
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:03,200
The killer's shoeprint is a size 39.

114
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,039
Flat sole.

115
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,120
Narrow heel,

116
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:06,440
and a small forefoot.

117
00:10:10,519 --> 00:10:11,399
Sure enough.

118
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:13,720
It's a woman.

119
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,720
All right, we're done here.

120
00:10:17,799 --> 00:10:18,679
Let's pack up.

121
00:11:01,879 --> 00:11:03,440
Here, take a look.

122
00:11:04,559 --> 00:11:06,200
The Hou family incident a few months ago...

123
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:07,120
Back then,

124
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:10,080
we turned the whole county

125
00:11:11,159 --> 00:11:12,480
upside down.

126
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:16,240
All the Hou family properties,

127
00:11:19,039 --> 00:11:20,519
from the warehouses

128
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:22,399
to the offices...

129
00:11:23,159 --> 00:11:25,000
I practically searched

130
00:11:25,639 --> 00:11:27,200
every single rat hole.

131
00:11:28,759 --> 00:11:29,679
And the result?

132
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,039
Not a single trace.

133
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,600
No contact from kidnappers,

134
00:11:34,519 --> 00:11:35,559
nothing at all.

135
00:11:35,559 --> 00:11:36,679
No bodies were found either.

136
00:11:36,759 --> 00:11:38,200
It was like three drops of water

137
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:43,120
falling onto a red-hot iron plate.

138
00:11:43,159 --> 00:11:45,240
Sizzled and gone, just like that.

139
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:46,360
Not a single mark,

140
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:48,000
not a single clue left behind.

141
00:11:52,639 --> 00:11:54,440
Three living, breathing people

142
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:56,120
vanished into thin air.

143
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:00,080
Other than foul play,

144
00:12:02,399 --> 00:12:04,240
what other explanation is there?

145
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:07,200
The Hou family was loaded.

146
00:12:09,919 --> 00:12:11,120
Hou Zhen and his wife,

147
00:12:12,159 --> 00:12:14,120
plus their son Hou Dong,

148
00:12:14,799 --> 00:12:15,639
the whole family

149
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:18,879
ran a pharmacy chain.

150
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,919
The money flowing on their books

151
00:12:21,159 --> 00:12:24,039
was in the tens of millions.

152
00:12:26,639 --> 00:12:28,039
After it happened,

153
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:29,360
Hou Ru

154
00:12:30,519 --> 00:12:35,840
became the sole heir to this huge fortune.

155
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:37,120
The beneficiary.

156
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:39,080
Beneficiary.

157
00:12:40,039 --> 00:12:40,919
Too bad,

158
00:12:43,279 --> 00:12:44,120
she's dead.

159
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:47,000
We watched her for months.

160
00:12:47,879 --> 00:12:49,279
Our eyes

161
00:12:50,559 --> 00:12:51,759
practically never left her.

162
00:12:51,919 --> 00:12:53,679
If she really were the killer,

163
00:12:53,679 --> 00:12:55,320
she was unbelievably steady.

164
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:56,720
Far too composed.

165
00:12:57,159 --> 00:12:58,559
Now that she's dead,

166
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:00,879
this case

167
00:13:02,519 --> 00:13:04,759
isn't just a simple disappearance anymore.

168
00:14:12,279 --> 00:14:13,639
Bloody Wedding

169
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:17,080
What did you say?

170
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:23,759
It's almost time.

171
00:14:23,840 --> 00:14:25,159
Why haven't your parents arrived yet?

172
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:26,159
Wait a little longer.

173
00:14:34,919 --> 00:14:36,879
Still no sign of your parents and brother.

174
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:41,399
How is it, honey?

175
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:43,399
Your parents...

176
00:14:43,799 --> 00:14:44,759
and brother...

177
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,399
still haven't been found.

178
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:49,159
Let's go.

179
00:14:49,679 --> 00:14:50,240
Move.

180
00:14:58,440 --> 00:14:59,720
I'm staying away from you.

181
00:15:01,039 --> 00:15:02,399
Don't splatter blood all over me.

182
00:15:07,919 --> 00:15:10,279
You've been watching too many movies.

183
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:19,399
At 5:58, Hou Ru

184
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,080
entered the neighborhood.

185
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:25,879
A woman in red,

186
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:27,120
wearing white gloves

187
00:15:27,519 --> 00:15:28,840
and with her cap pulled low,

188
00:15:29,399 --> 00:15:30,399
followed her inside.

189
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:39,919
Stop.

190
00:15:42,279 --> 00:15:43,080
Looks like

191
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:45,559
she followed her the whole way.

192
00:15:47,159 --> 00:15:48,320
She knew her way around.

193
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:53,320
Yet she didn't take any valuables.

194
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:56,279
Then the target...

195
00:15:57,279 --> 00:15:58,200
was the person.

196
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:05,000
Let's go back to the crime scene.

197
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:09,279
Maybe we really

198
00:16:11,039 --> 00:16:12,279
missed something.

199
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:39,159
Mentor

200
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:20,440
Smell this.

201
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:22,079
Smell of hair oil.

202
00:17:32,319 --> 00:17:33,200
Pepper spray.

203
00:17:40,559 --> 00:17:41,759
Then I get it.

204
00:17:42,680 --> 00:17:44,319
That day, after Hou Ru got home,

205
00:17:45,079 --> 00:17:46,200
she walked up to the door,

206
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:48,039
used her key to unlock it,

207
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:51,400
completely unaware that behind her...

208
00:18:02,519 --> 00:18:05,480
Footage from Hou Ru's complex a week ago.

209
00:18:20,839 --> 00:18:22,000
This is

210
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:23,799
the woman in the red coat from that day.

211
00:18:25,039 --> 00:18:25,960
She was Casing the place.

212
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:30,799
This woman

213
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:33,319
was coming straight for Hou Ru.

214
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:35,759
From start to finish,

215
00:18:36,799 --> 00:18:40,079
this was a meticulously planned

216
00:18:40,319 --> 00:18:41,000
hunt.
